@host = http://localhost:5080
# Replace these local placeholders with the distinct generated credentials.
@operatorKey = COPY_OPERATOR_KEY
@reviewerKey = COPY_REVIEWER_KEY
@workflowId = COPY_WORKFLOW_ID
@reviewDigest = COPY_REVIEW_DIGEST
@revision = 1

### Public API specification
GET {{host}}/openapi.json

### Create short URL
POST {{host}}/api/urls
X-Api-Key: {{operatorKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"https://example.com","expiresInDays":30}

### Start real generation and validation (fault injection must be enabled)
POST {{host}}/api/workflows
X-Api-Key: {{operatorKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requirement":"Build HTTPS-only links with expiration and click analytics","scenario":"greenfield","simulateTestFailure":true}

### Inspect current revision and digest
GET {{host}}/api/workflows/{{workflowId}}
X-Api-Key: {{reviewerKey}}

### Inspect generated code
GET {{host}}/api/workflows/{{workflowId}}/artifacts/app/FeaturePolicy.cs
X-Api-Key: {{reviewerKey}}

### Verify journal
GET {{host}}/api/workflows/{{workflowId}}/audit
X-Api-Key: {{reviewerKey}}

### Approve exact evidence with separate reviewer credential
POST {{host}}/api/workflows/{{workflowId}}/approval
X-Api-Key: {{reviewerKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":true,"revision":{{revision}},"evidenceHash":"{{reviewDigest}}","reason":"Reviewed generated source, executed tests, and risks"}

### Replan current revision before completion
POST {{host}}/api/workflows/{{workflowId}}/replan
X-Api-Key: {{operatorKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requirement":"Add expiration and click analytics","revision":{{revision}}}

### Reliability metrics
GET {{host}}/api/workflows/metrics
X-Api-Key: {{operatorKey}}
